    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "one GEMM configuration, written as two identical samples"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Raw Output Example",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "sample_index,status,function,dtype,transposeA,transposeB,M,N,K,lda,ldb,ldc,batch_count,cold_iters,hot_iters,rocblas_gflops,rocblas_gemm_us,cpu_gflops,norm_error_1,achieved_compute_tflops,kernel_time_msec,minimum_operand_traffic_gb_s,relative_l1_checked_columns,error_message\n0,ok,gemm,f32_r,N,N,4096,4096,4096,4096,4096,4096,1,5,20,12000,80,8000,1e-6,12,0.08,1500,1e-6,"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "run_benchmark Command Plus Options for Smoke Run",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "bash run_benchmark.sh --smoke --validate --dtype f32_r --M 64 --N 64 --K 64 --transposeA N --transposeB N --alpha 1 --beta 0 --lda 64 --ldb 64 --ldc 64 --batch-count 1 --warmup-iters 2 --num-iterations 2 --norm-check 1"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "run_benchmark Command Plus Options for Baseline Run",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "bash run_benchmark.sh --baseline --validate --dtype f32_r --M 4096 --N 4096 --K 4096 --transposeA N --transposeB N --alpha 1 --beta 0 --lda 4096 --ldb 4096 --ldc 4096 --batch-count 1 --warmup-iters 5 --num-iterations 200000 --norm-check 1"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "run_benchmark Command Plus Options for Extended Run",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "bash run_benchmark.sh --extended --validate --dtype f32_r --M 4096 --N 4096 --K 4096 --transposeA N --transposeB N --alpha 1 --beta 0 --lda 4096 --ldb 4096 --ldc 4096 --batch-count 1 --warmup-iters 10 --num-iterations 480000 --norm-check 1"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Output Fields / Metrics to Parse",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "achieved_compute_tflops, kernel_time_msec, minimum_operand_traffic_gb_s, relative_l1_checked_columns, norm_error_1, cpu_gflops, rocblas_gflops, rocblas_gemm_us"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Success Criteria",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "rocblas-bench exits 0 and prints a rocblas-Gflops/us row; with norm_check=1 it also prints CPU-Gflops and norm_error_1"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Parser and Normalization Notes",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Columns are read by name from the rocblas-bench CSV header, so extra columns in other rocBLAS versions are ignored. With norm_check=0, cpu_gflops and norm_error_1 are na (norm_check is 0). Before 2026-10-01 this collector timed torch.matmul and did not run rocblas-bench. norm_error_2 is omitted because rocblas-bench does not print an L2 norm"
  },
